WEBVTT

00:01.962 --> 00:04.342
[narrator] Our battle against the monsters

00:04.425 --> 00:07.682
began the day
the floating fortress appeared.

00:09.728 --> 00:11.272
Monsters do not die.

00:11.774 --> 00:15.447
With their immortal bodies,
the monsters attack humans mercilessly.

00:16.491 --> 00:18.746
However, we humans will never lose!

00:19.413 --> 00:21.585
Not when we can destroy them
with the Divine Artifact,

00:21.669 --> 00:25.092
a weapon created
one year after the war started!

00:30.018 --> 00:33.859
With the Divine Artifact, we will protect
the humans from the evil monsters!

00:34.569 --> 00:35.863
That's what we Rangers do!

00:36.782 --> 00:38.577
[panting]

00:38.661 --> 00:41.875
All right, ten laps left! Push!

00:41.959 --> 00:44.840
[Fighter D] Yeah, yeah… I know.

00:45.424 --> 00:47.011
What's wrong with his hair?

00:47.094 --> 00:50.017
-Good, you're all doing great! Keep going!
-[Fighter D] I'll crush them all!

00:50.100 --> 00:55.360
Wait, never mind. Maybe these small fries
don't even know it's all just a show.

00:55.945 --> 00:57.532
Sorry about that, I went too far.

00:58.408 --> 01:00.788
But his hairstyle really is strange.

01:01.874 --> 01:03.544
Stay cool…

01:04.629 --> 01:07.552
Don't forget why I infiltrated
the enemy stronghold.

01:08.178 --> 01:09.556
The ones I'm after are those five

01:09.640 --> 01:13.814
who were there
when our bosses were wiped out that day.

01:14.733 --> 01:16.235
The Dragon Keepers.

01:17.530 --> 01:19.534
[♪ theme music]

01:21.747 --> 01:23.416
Go! Go! Loser Ranger!

02:48.044 --> 02:49.380
Episode 2
Go! Fighter D!

02:49.463 --> 02:50.508
[Fighter D] What?

02:50.591 --> 02:52.762
The Dragon Keepers aren't here?

02:53.429 --> 02:56.269
-Isn't this the Rangers' HQ?
-That's right.

02:56.352 --> 02:59.024
-And you don't think that's weird?
-Not at all.

02:59.108 --> 03:00.570
Is this some kind of riddle?

03:01.237 --> 03:04.034
If you're trying to make me think,
please stop. I'm not good at that.

03:04.118 --> 03:05.287
Give me a hint or something--

03:05.370 --> 03:06.665
[recruiter] Found you!

03:07.792 --> 03:12.009
So you came to take the recruitment exam!
I'm so touched!

03:12.719 --> 03:14.848
[grunts, sighs]

03:14.931 --> 03:16.602
Oh, you're the one from the other day…

03:18.606 --> 03:20.191
I'm glad I invited you!

03:21.820 --> 03:23.364
Welcome to the Ranger Force!

03:23.448 --> 03:24.618
[Suzukiri] Sorry about that.

03:25.493 --> 03:28.876
I told Sakurama about you,
and he got so excited.

03:29.544 --> 03:31.339
You could fail the exam, for all we know.

03:31.923 --> 03:32.967
Right?

03:34.428 --> 03:37.434
Don't be so rude, Suzukiri!

03:38.227 --> 03:41.025
I believe in you!
You'll pass, I'm sure of it!

03:41.108 --> 03:42.110
[whimpers]

03:42.194 --> 03:44.699
You'll be fine!
You can do it so long as you will it!

03:44.783 --> 03:48.331
[Fighter D]
H-Hey, don't touch me so casually!

03:48.414 --> 03:52.089
Fighters have fragile bodies
compared to you surface-dwellers!

03:52.172 --> 03:53.466
Huh?

03:55.178 --> 03:56.515
Uh…

03:57.975 --> 03:59.395
[nervous grunt]

04:01.482 --> 04:03.654
-[gasps]
-[Suzukiri] Hey…

04:03.737 --> 04:05.323
Have you had lunch yet?

04:05.407 --> 04:07.704
We're going to have some food now.
Do you want to join us?

04:07.787 --> 04:10.417
Sounds good! Let's have a get-together
before you officially join us!

04:10.501 --> 04:13.464
[Fighter D]
They don't even know I'm a monster.

04:13.549 --> 04:15.594
-Well then, let's get going!
-[Fighter D] How dumb.

04:16.178 --> 04:18.642
I finally sneaked into the Ranger Force!

04:19.393 --> 04:21.480
Surface-dwellers are so gullible!

04:21.565 --> 04:23.652
Come on, hurry up! Let's go!

04:23.736 --> 04:25.488
[Fighter D] Oh, sorry about that.

04:26.157 --> 04:30.750
[Fighter C] Hey, wait!
Not there… Stop… I said no!

04:30.958 --> 04:32.962
Oh, yeah, I win!

04:33.045 --> 04:35.467
Damn it, that didn't count!
Let's play one more round!

04:35.551 --> 04:38.347
Man, I could play this game forever.

04:38.473 --> 04:40.686
[Fighter G] Bad news, guys!

04:41.395 --> 04:43.191
I-I-I-It's…

04:43.274 --> 04:44.861
Huh?

04:52.960 --> 04:55.925
[panting]
M-May I ask why you're here?

04:57.302 --> 05:01.853
Hey, no need to be so nervous.
I'm not here to fight.

05:02.688 --> 05:03.857
[gasps]

05:03.941 --> 05:08.074
We're fellow comrades who formed
a truce agreement. Just relax, yeah?

05:08.157 --> 05:10.120
Come on, smile.

05:10.203 --> 05:12.040
[forced laugh]

05:12.124 --> 05:15.046
-[Blue Keeper] This isn't funny.
-[gasps]

05:15.129 --> 05:18.929
You know that one of your friends
betrayed us, right?

05:21.016 --> 05:25.191
Don't tell me
that everyone in the fortress is in on it.

05:25.275 --> 05:28.949
-N-No… Fighter D decided that on his own…
-Huh?

05:29.032 --> 05:30.493
This isn't good, yeah?

05:30.578 --> 05:33.499
For a group of guys who look the same,
you don't seem to think the same way.

05:33.584 --> 05:34.919
You'd better not be scamming us!

05:35.003 --> 05:36.380
G-Got it…

05:36.463 --> 05:37.508
Anyway…

05:38.552 --> 05:40.514
That traitor from yesterday,
show yourself!

05:42.643 --> 05:43.854
Uh…

05:43.937 --> 05:49.281
The thing is, Fighter D hasn't returned
since that battle.

05:49.364 --> 05:50.408
What?

05:51.076 --> 05:55.001
You guys aren't hiding and covering
for his ass, are you?

05:55.084 --> 05:58.174
N-No! We wouldn't do that…
[whines]

05:58.257 --> 05:59.802
Fine.

06:00.303 --> 06:02.098
Time to exercise
shared responsibility then.

06:02.182 --> 06:03.727
You'll take his place and fix things!

06:03.810 --> 06:05.689
Wait… What?

06:05.773 --> 06:07.233
[Red Keeper] That's not right, Blue.

06:07.317 --> 06:12.494
They've been betrayed as well.
We're both suffering from the same sorrow.

06:12.578 --> 06:17.045
The only one at fault is that Fighter D
who can't get with the program.

06:17.964 --> 06:19.091
Guess you're right.

06:19.174 --> 06:22.723
My bad. Report to us once he gets back.

06:22.807 --> 06:24.226
O-Of course!

06:24.309 --> 06:26.898
I have faith in you guys.

06:27.357 --> 06:30.238
We're partners who stuck through
thick and thin for more than a decade.

06:30.906 --> 06:34.246
[Red Keeper] However, we've decided
to take some safety measures

06:34.329 --> 06:36.751
to prevent similar unfortunate events
from happening again.

06:40.049 --> 06:42.387
From here on, these two will be stationed

06:42.470 --> 06:44.266
in the floating fortress
along with their men.

06:44.349 --> 06:45.644
[gasps]

06:46.353 --> 06:47.732
Rejoice!

06:47.815 --> 06:51.113
We'll be setting up a Blue Squadron's
Floating Fortress Subgarrison!

06:52.198 --> 06:53.618
From now on,

06:53.702 --> 06:58.127
you'll live under their supervision
and take orders from them when needed.

06:58.210 --> 06:59.463
[grunts]

06:59.547 --> 07:01.467
That's fine, right?

07:01.551 --> 07:02.553
That's just too sudden…

07:02.636 --> 07:04.222
-You can't decide this on your own!
-[gasps]

07:04.347 --> 07:05.809
This fortress belongs to us monsters!

07:05.934 --> 07:09.149
How dare you do this without asking us!
This is tyranny!

07:09.274 --> 07:10.861
-[Fighter F] Hey, stop that!
-[grunts]

07:11.529 --> 07:14.660
I won't! We should speak up
at times like this!

07:14.744 --> 07:17.750
We have the right to our privacy too!

07:17.917 --> 07:21.048
-Hey! You forgot about our deal?
-Stop, C--

07:22.885 --> 07:24.054
Shut the hell up.

07:26.183 --> 07:28.897
[Blue Keeper] Keep yapping,
and I'll kill you!

07:28.980 --> 07:30.943
-Stop, please!
-[scoffs]

07:31.026 --> 07:33.447
We won't fight back. We'll listen to you!

07:33.532 --> 07:35.451
[Fighter C] Fighter A…

07:35.536 --> 07:39.710
Good, seems like we can get along.
This is the ideal partnership.

07:40.294 --> 07:43.510
The weak should listen to the strong
and not fight back,

07:43.593 --> 07:46.265
while the strong should not have
any reason to worry about the weak.

07:46.766 --> 07:50.231
Conflicts only happen when one party
doesn't understand their place.

07:50.732 --> 07:53.947
Today, we took one step
towards achieving world peace.

07:54.030 --> 08:00.168
Those who betray us and disrupt peace
shall reap retribution!

08:03.424 --> 08:05.846
[all gasp]

08:07.725 --> 08:09.729
Traitors will be killed mercilessly.

08:09.812 --> 08:11.858
Just like how we killed your bosses.

08:12.943 --> 08:13.987
[Fighter A] Yes.

08:14.070 --> 08:17.118
We'll never go against you again!

08:17.202 --> 08:21.210
[Fighter F] That's right.
I can't do anything stupid like he did.

08:21.711 --> 08:26.053
I'll listen to the Rangers
and continue to live on in shame.

08:26.930 --> 08:29.351
That's all I can do now.

08:30.061 --> 08:31.355
[sighs]

08:31.438 --> 08:34.486
Is that really… all I can do?

08:37.158 --> 08:39.496
Knife on my right hand, fork on my left.

08:39.997 --> 08:41.500
I've got this down!

08:45.383 --> 08:48.640
Oh, yeah… You were asking
about the Dragon Keepers, right?

08:49.391 --> 08:51.938
[Suzukiri] They're usually not at HQ.

08:52.021 --> 08:54.401
You'll find them
at their respective garrisons,

08:54.484 --> 08:56.238
which are spread out
across Amanogawa city.

08:56.739 --> 09:00.288
A Ranger's duties are not limited
to monster exterminations!

09:00.371 --> 09:03.085
[Sakurama] We participate in clean-up
activities in the local regions

09:03.168 --> 09:06.300
and even resolve cases and conflicts
with the police.

09:06.926 --> 09:10.057
Our activities wouldn't be possible
without support from the general public.

09:10.141 --> 09:12.813
Societal contribution is the foundation
of everything we do!

09:13.523 --> 09:14.650
I see.

09:14.734 --> 09:16.069
Then they're really gonna hate it

09:16.153 --> 09:18.825
if they find out that the battles
with the monsters are just an act.

09:18.908 --> 09:21.330
-[both] Huh?
-[gasps]

09:21.413 --> 09:24.294
-No, what I meant was…
-[chuckles]

09:24.377 --> 09:26.841
-I watched that video too, you know.
-What?

09:26.924 --> 09:29.722
Some video saying
it's all some ploy by the Rangers.

09:29.805 --> 09:31.141
Sounds fishy, right?

09:31.224 --> 09:34.230
What's that all about?
That's unforgivable!

09:34.314 --> 09:36.151
Right, right! That!

09:36.234 --> 09:37.738
[sheepish chuckle]

09:40.368 --> 09:41.370
[Fighter D] I see how it is.

09:42.080 --> 09:45.002
Maybe they really don't know
what's going on.

09:45.086 --> 09:47.382
Guess I'll have to wait and see.

09:47.465 --> 09:49.052
[child] Hey, Mister Ranger!

09:49.135 --> 09:50.388
[Sakurama] Oh…

09:51.974 --> 09:53.018
[mother chuckles softly]

09:53.728 --> 09:57.110
Thank you so much for saving us
from the monster the other day.

09:57.986 --> 09:59.532
Please take a photo with me!

10:00.449 --> 10:01.619
This is on the house too.

10:02.453 --> 10:04.290
Wow! Are you sure about that?

10:04.374 --> 10:06.921
[manager] Just a small token
of appreciation for always helping us.

10:09.134 --> 10:10.219
Let's see…

10:12.056 --> 10:14.979
It's true that some people
have yet to acknowledge us.

10:15.564 --> 10:16.607
Still,

10:16.691 --> 10:21.032
I'm proud to be a member
of the honorable Ranger Force.

10:22.870 --> 10:26.753
[Fighter D] Yeah. Of course,
you guys would love it.

10:26.836 --> 10:31.052
Food must taste great when you have
people showering you with praises.

10:33.390 --> 10:36.564
We don't even get to see
delicacies like this back in the fortress.

10:36.647 --> 10:38.275
[Suzukiri] Thank you for the food.

10:38.358 --> 10:41.448
Well, guess we'd better get started
on our afternoon duties.

10:41.532 --> 10:43.828
Oh, it's that time already?

10:44.412 --> 10:45.414
See you.

10:50.007 --> 10:51.636
[Sakurama] Where are you going, Suzukiri?

10:51.719 --> 10:53.013
[Suzukiri] The Red Garrison.

10:53.096 --> 10:54.432
[Fighter D] The Red Garrison?

10:54.767 --> 10:58.023
[Suzukiri] I'm going there to deliver
a letter. Do you want to come along?

10:58.106 --> 11:00.737
You're a huge fan of Red Keeper,
aren't you, Sakurama?

11:00.821 --> 11:02.031
[Fighter D chuckles]

11:03.826 --> 11:05.747
Hey! Come here, little guy!

11:08.168 --> 11:10.674
Can I see the photo you took
with everyone just now?

11:10.757 --> 11:14.640
[Fighter D] Stay cool, stay cool…
Don't be hasty.

11:15.559 --> 11:18.565
I'm a cold-blooded,
cool-headed, and proud monster.

11:18.648 --> 11:21.152
Let me take a closer look here.

11:23.282 --> 11:25.452
This isn't the stage
for your kind to shine.

11:25.537 --> 11:28.083
[Red Keeper] Just shut up and lose
like you're supposed to.

11:28.166 --> 11:30.254
We are justice!

11:35.599 --> 11:36.642
Hmm?

11:36.726 --> 11:37.936
[whimpers in fear]

11:38.563 --> 11:40.316
Mommy!

11:40.399 --> 11:41.694
Hmm? Huh?

11:41.777 --> 11:43.781
[manager] You're still here, Mr. Ranger?

11:45.785 --> 11:48.708
[Fighter D] Yeah. Thanks for the food.

11:57.433 --> 12:00.439
[Suzukiri]
I didn't expect you to really come along.

12:00.523 --> 12:01.609
[nervous chuckle]

12:02.193 --> 12:04.447
They suddenly told me
I'm on an afternoon break, so…

12:04.907 --> 12:06.201
[gasps]

12:07.537 --> 12:09.123
[Fighter D] I'm cool-headed…

12:11.044 --> 12:12.965
I'm just here to scout the area today…

12:19.561 --> 12:23.485
You mind letting me
deliver the letter to Red Keeper?

12:25.573 --> 12:26.701
[soft grunt]

12:28.286 --> 12:30.249
Sure. Here you go.

12:38.306 --> 12:40.394
This is Yumeko Suzukiri
from Yellow Squadron,

12:40.477 --> 12:42.314
and Independent Hibiki Sakurama.

12:42.398 --> 12:43.735
Coming in!

12:49.328 --> 12:50.623
[Fighter D] I can do it.

12:51.207 --> 12:54.255
I'm cool-headed, so I can go for his head
once he shows an opening.

12:55.174 --> 12:58.013
But because I'm cool-headed,
I have a question.

12:58.681 --> 13:02.021
I've only met Red Keeper during combat.

13:02.689 --> 13:08.283
My question is,
does he wear his mask outside of combat?

13:08.366 --> 13:09.912
[rangers exclaim in wonder]

13:12.416 --> 13:14.212
Which one's Red?

13:15.715 --> 13:16.842
Suzukiri…

13:16.926 --> 13:18.428
[ranger] Hey, hey! Stop right there.

13:19.472 --> 13:23.355
Suzukiri aside,
what's a colorless brat doing here?

13:24.482 --> 13:27.154
I have some business with Red Keeper.

13:27.238 --> 13:30.494
Oh, really?
You could've just said that earlier.

13:30.578 --> 13:32.999
Well, like I said,
I'm here to meet Red Keeper…

13:33.083 --> 13:34.962
I'm Red Keeper.

13:35.045 --> 13:36.381
[Fighter D] What?

13:36.464 --> 13:38.970
-No way. I meet him right off the bat?
-[soft chuckle]

13:40.807 --> 13:42.602
At this range…

13:43.938 --> 13:44.982
I can kill him!

13:45.065 --> 13:48.238
-That joke isn't even funny.
-Huh?

13:48.321 --> 13:50.994
You're a Senior Third Rank, aren't you?

13:51.077 --> 13:52.121
Tokita.

13:52.204 --> 13:53.248
[Fighter D] What the heck?

13:53.331 --> 13:54.417
[scoffs]

13:55.460 --> 13:56.421
Phew!

13:57.047 --> 13:59.468
Doesn't change the fact
that I'm gonna be the future Red.

13:59.553 --> 14:00.972
By the way…

14:01.807 --> 14:03.728
What were you trying to do?

14:03.811 --> 14:05.230
Uh…

14:06.692 --> 14:08.905
[Fighter D] Not good.
I can't talk my way out of this one!

14:09.405 --> 14:10.909
-Excuse me…
-Hmm?

14:10.992 --> 14:13.163
-You're hurting me…
-[Tokita] Hmm.

14:13.246 --> 14:17.254
I need to deliver a letter
to Red Keeper personally.

14:17.338 --> 14:19.175
Isn't that right, Suzukiri?

14:19.801 --> 14:20.929
-Huh…
-[Fighter D grunts]

14:21.012 --> 14:24.937
You're acting kinda weird today, Hibiki.

14:25.020 --> 14:27.943
[Fighter D] Don't tell me,
this guy knows Sakurama?

14:28.026 --> 14:30.447
H-Hey… Tokita-san.

14:30.615 --> 14:33.453
Huh? "Tokita-san"?

14:33.621 --> 14:36.250
You okay?
Just call me like you usually do.

14:36.334 --> 14:39.298
[grunts]
T-Tokita-kun!

14:39.382 --> 14:41.094
Tokita-sama? Tokita-chan?

14:41.260 --> 14:42.388
Hey, you!

14:42.514 --> 14:45.687
Shun, it's not nice to bully your juniors.

14:45.770 --> 14:47.941
-[grunts]
-Suzukiri…

14:48.024 --> 14:49.110
-And you too, Sakurama.
-[mutters in anger]

14:49.193 --> 14:50.947
Stop being stubborn
and give him the letter!

14:51.030 --> 14:53.034
-O-Okay.
-[scoffs]

14:53.201 --> 14:55.455
You sure? I thought
you needed to deliver it personally.

14:55.540 --> 14:59.463
Well, I'm sure he'll allow it since
I'm giving it to the future Red Keeper.

14:59.548 --> 15:00.591
[chuckles]

15:00.675 --> 15:03.723
Glad you know how things work here!
Should've just done this from the start.

15:04.683 --> 15:07.605
[Tokita]
Suzukiri, I've taken a shine to you.

15:07.689 --> 15:11.530
Isn't it boring at the Yellow Squadron
since it specializes in R&D?

15:11.613 --> 15:12.699
You should come join us.

15:12.782 --> 15:19.336
Well… Thanks for the invitation,
but I prefer more freedom in my work.

15:19.420 --> 15:21.508
[Tokita] The Red Squadron's pretty good.

15:21.592 --> 15:24.598
We're a monster extermination
specialist team.

15:24.681 --> 15:27.896
Every Ranger dreams of defeating monsters,
don't they?

15:27.979 --> 15:30.442
Even an Independent dude like you
agrees with me, right?

15:31.360 --> 15:33.031
[Fighter D] Now I remember.

15:33.114 --> 15:37.039
These are all familiar faces
on the battlefield.

15:37.122 --> 15:39.376
[Suzukiri] Shall we get going, Sakurama?

15:39.460 --> 15:40.505
O-Okay!

15:41.089 --> 15:42.759
[ranger 1] I'm with you on that.

15:43.426 --> 15:46.140
I want to become a Dragon Keeper
and take down a boss.

15:46.224 --> 15:47.434
[ranger 2] But you know,

15:47.519 --> 15:50.775
I killed three of those last month
and got some recognition for that!

15:50.858 --> 15:54.950
[ranger 3] Three's too little!
My best record is five!

15:55.033 --> 15:56.369
[ranger 4] Come on, mine's six…

16:01.087 --> 16:02.590
[Fighter D] I'm cool-headed…

16:03.717 --> 16:05.972
I know very well how strong they are.

16:06.807 --> 16:11.525
I'm not running away.
I'm just… retreating for now…

16:12.777 --> 16:17.035
But this… Isn't it the same…
as what I've always been doing?

16:17.119 --> 16:18.204
Oh.

16:18.288 --> 16:19.541
We are recruiting!
DRAGON KEEPERS

16:19.624 --> 16:21.670
Sousei Akabane
(Red Keeper)

16:21.753 --> 16:24.049
[Fighter D] Huh? Isn't this…

16:24.676 --> 16:26.053
[lift dings]

16:31.607 --> 16:33.026
Red Keeper?

16:34.529 --> 16:36.157
Yes, that's me.

16:38.328 --> 16:39.664
[grunts]

16:39.748 --> 16:41.209
What is it, Ranger?

16:41.292 --> 16:43.672
[Fighter D]
He's fine parading his face everywhere?

16:47.764 --> 16:48.849
Move!

16:50.603 --> 16:52.941
What's the point in holding back now?

16:53.567 --> 16:57.825
Sakurama. I know you idolize him,
but don't get too excited.

16:57.909 --> 16:58.953
Wait! Hey…

16:59.036 --> 17:01.040
-Hmm.
-R-Red Keeper!

17:01.123 --> 17:02.209
-Hey, Sakurama…
-Hmm?

17:02.292 --> 17:04.798
Congratulations on the victory
in the last Sunday Showdown!

17:04.881 --> 17:09.098
But you never know what despicable tricks
the monsters may resort to!

17:09.181 --> 17:10.601
Please be careful!

17:11.394 --> 17:12.605
[in English] Thank you.

17:12.689 --> 17:15.193
[Red Keeper in Japanese]
I'm glad to have juniors like you!

17:19.536 --> 17:22.416
[birds squawking]

17:22.499 --> 17:24.003
[Suzukiri] I broke out in a cold sweat

17:24.044 --> 17:27.134
when you suddenly talked
to that Sousei Akabane.

17:27.217 --> 17:28.595
Are you listening?

17:28.679 --> 17:31.602
-Forget it. Give me the knife.
-What?

17:31.685 --> 17:34.064
I'm talking about the knife in your pouch.

17:34.148 --> 17:35.233
Oh, right…

17:35.901 --> 17:37.655
In the end, I couldn't even use it.

17:37.739 --> 17:39.743
Wait. Did I ever tell you
about that, Suzukiri--

17:40.452 --> 17:41.495
[Fighter D grunts]

17:42.205 --> 17:43.207
[thuds]

17:46.172 --> 17:47.800
[Fighter D groaning]

17:48.677 --> 17:50.765
What, what? How did you find out--

17:50.848 --> 17:53.019
[Suzukiri] You're really weak,

17:53.102 --> 17:55.482
so you'll be exposed immediately
if you're not careful.

17:55.566 --> 17:56.651
[Fighter D] What?

17:57.152 --> 17:59.949
[Suzukiri] I've been trying
to cover for you the entire day.

18:00.450 --> 18:02.705
But I guess it's commendable

18:02.789 --> 18:05.001
that you stood your ground
back there and stayed calm.

18:05.085 --> 18:08.759
Even if you tried taking Red on,
he would've just turned the tables on you.

18:08.842 --> 18:10.721
Just who are you?

18:10.805 --> 18:12.474
Your enemy.

18:12.558 --> 18:14.729
I won't be defeated at a place like this!

18:15.898 --> 18:16.983
Damn it, not again--

18:17.067 --> 18:18.904
Hey! Seriously! Stop--

18:20.031 --> 18:22.411
For now, let's take a moment
and talk things out, okay?

18:22.494 --> 18:24.999
[chuckles]
You'd hear an enemy out?

18:25.083 --> 18:27.003
Thanks, you're really nice.

18:28.172 --> 18:30.093
In that case, I have a favor to ask.

18:30.176 --> 18:31.555
[grunting]

18:32.723 --> 18:35.563
-Let's work together, you and I.
-What?

18:35.646 --> 18:39.988
I can teach you
the way to defeat the Rangers.

18:40.071 --> 18:43.954
And then…
let's destroy the Ranger Force together.

18:45.457 --> 18:46.459
[Sakurama] Suzukiri!

18:46.543 --> 18:48.922
I finally found you! There's an emergency.

18:49.674 --> 18:51.511
A monster has appeared nearby.

18:51.595 --> 18:55.310
[Fighter D] That's impossible.
It's not Sunday today!

18:55.644 --> 18:57.439
-What's going on?
-I'll be helping out with the evacuation.

18:57.523 --> 19:00.403
-The civilians' safety is our priority!
-Got it.

19:00.487 --> 19:03.284
Hey, stay close to me…

19:03.367 --> 19:04.495
Huh?

19:13.972 --> 19:14.974
[scoffs]

19:16.060 --> 19:17.980
[grunting]

19:18.064 --> 19:19.984
-Wait up, will ya?
-Hey!

19:20.068 --> 19:22.740
[Sakurama] Please stand back!
It's dangerous!

19:22.823 --> 19:24.994
-Please! Stand back!
-F! What is he doing here?

19:25.119 --> 19:26.497
[ranger] Damn it, stand still!

19:26.581 --> 19:28.710
-[grunting]
-[gunshot]

19:30.338 --> 19:33.887
Oh, yeah, got him with a headshot!
[chuckles]

19:33.971 --> 19:36.100
Come on, monster.
Don't make it hard for me.

19:36.183 --> 19:37.269
You're just a small fry,

19:37.352 --> 19:39.481
so stop putting up a fight
and regenerating over and over again.

19:39.566 --> 19:41.736
The heck? You're pissing me off.

19:41.820 --> 19:44.534
I can't find him anyway,
so I'll just go back like you wanted!

19:44.617 --> 19:46.245
[Red Keeper] Who said you could go back?

19:46.328 --> 19:47.497
[gasps]
What?

19:52.048 --> 19:54.136
Sousei Akabane. Transform.

20:04.072 --> 20:05.366
I'll be your opponent.

20:05.618 --> 20:07.454
What… You're…

20:07.538 --> 20:08.707
Red Keeper!

20:08.790 --> 20:11.170
[Tokita] Get back, everyone!
Red's going to fight!

20:11.253 --> 20:13.926
I just gave you a warning
not too long ago,

20:14.009 --> 20:15.679
and you're already betraying us?

20:17.265 --> 20:19.144
[Fighter D] I've seen that thing before.

20:19.227 --> 20:22.067
There's no mistaking it.
That's the real thing!

20:22.192 --> 20:24.237
Villains will always be villains.

20:24.321 --> 20:27.118
You will be purged in the name of justice.

20:27.202 --> 20:30.208
-[gasps]
-You may have died multiple times,

20:30.375 --> 20:32.546
but you shall learn
what true death is like.

20:32.630 --> 20:34.299
Divine Artifact, Manifest.

20:36.178 --> 20:38.474
Red Dragon Salamandra!

20:38.558 --> 20:39.769
[dragon roars]

20:45.572 --> 20:48.578
[Fighter F] Oh, well.
I knew this was going to happen.

20:49.706 --> 20:52.586
I mean, I'm just a fighter, you know?

20:53.295 --> 20:57.220
D, where are you?
What are you trying to do?

20:57.638 --> 21:02.272
I kind of get it…
It's just as that bastard Red said.

21:02.355 --> 21:03.942
We may have made a deal,

21:04.026 --> 21:06.363
and we may try to bask in
the civilians' cheers…

21:06.447 --> 21:10.204
but it doesn't change the fact that
we're villains out to invade the surface.

21:10.288 --> 21:12.500
After all,
we're the Nefarious Monster Army.

21:13.043 --> 21:14.212
Come at me!

21:14.296 --> 21:15.549
F!

21:28.407 --> 21:30.996
Ultimate Technique, Yamata no Orochi.

21:31.079 --> 21:32.958
Nice. That was cool!

21:37.885 --> 21:40.808
[Fighter F] Sorry, D… I lost.

21:40.891 --> 21:41.893
[inaudible chatter]

21:41.976 --> 21:44.899
I fought, and I lost.

21:48.615 --> 21:51.538
But compared to the last
13 meaningless years…

21:51.621 --> 21:53.165
[inaudible chatter]

21:54.417 --> 21:57.257
…I feel good today.

22:07.193 --> 22:09.239
[♪ closing theme music]

23:33.908 --> 23:35.912
Translated by Qianni Lu

23:35.996 --> 23:37.457
♪ Someday… ♪

23:37.541 --> 23:38.877
[sighs]
You've got it wrong.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.212
♪ Someday… ♪

23:40.296 --> 23:42.760
-♪ Someday… ♪
-Like I said, you got it wrong!

23:42.843 --> 23:45.056
[clears throat]
♪ Someday… ♪

23:45.139 --> 23:46.350
All right, all together now!

23:46.433 --> 23:49.397
[both] ♪ "Our Evil Will Bloom, Someday!" ♪

23:49.481 --> 23:50.901
Perfect!
